00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,250
Under the hood, only approved actions reach the chain.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:05,704
AI analysis runs with no keys.

3
00:00:05,704 --> 00:00:08,087
An admin wallet signs one approval.

4
00:00:08,087 --> 00:00:12,468
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only part with a key, act.

5
00:00:12,468 --> 00:00:16,276
Our AgentProvenance contract records who proposed and who approved.

6
00:00:16,276 --> 00:00:17,678
Agents propose.

7
00:00:17,678 --> 00:00:18,960
Humans approve.

8
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,295
Chains prove.

